DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The vvmm__mmaapp__lloocckk() macro obtains an exclusive lock on _m_a_p.

     The vvmm__mmaapp__uunnlloocckk() macro releases an exclusive lock on _m_a_p.

     The vvmm__mmaapp__lloocckk__rreeaadd() macro obtains a read-lock on _m_a_p.

     The vvmm__mmaapp__uunnlloocckk__rreeaadd() macro releases a read-lock on _m_a_p.

     The vvmm__mmaapp__ttrryylloocckk() macro attempts to obtain an exclusive lock on _m_a_p.
     It returns FALSE if the lock cannot be immediately acquired; otherwise
     return TRUE with the lock acquired.

     The vvmm__mmaapp__ttrryylloocckk__rreeaadd() macro attempts to obtain a read-lock on _m_a_p.
     It returns FALSE if the lock cannot be immediately acquired; otherwise
     return TRUE with the lock acquired.

     The vvmm__mmaapp__lloocckk__uuppggrraaddee() macro attempts to atomically upgrade a read-
     lock on _m_a_p to an exclusive lock.

     The vvmm__mmaapp__lloocckk__ddoowwnnggrraaddee() macro attempts to downgrade an exclusive lock
     on _m_a_p to a read-lock.

IIMMPPLLEEMMEENNTTAATTIIOONN NNOOTTEESS
     Currently, all of the locking macros implement their locks as sleep
     locks.

